# A seal that warps is not a seal. Every file is checked out exactly as stored, on every OS (no CRLF
# conversion), so the sha256 pins, the golden files and the white-page census hold on a Windows
# clone with core.autocrlf=true.
* -text
*.rs text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.aether text eol=lf
*.hbp text eol=lf
*.hbi text eol=lf
*.sha256 text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
.gitignore text eol=lf
